  lastDinner:
    question:
    - speaker: Daughter
      text: You came home.
    - speaker: Daughter
      text: Papa, I don't feel very well.
    - speaker: Daughter
      text: I knocked on Greer's door. On Hollis's door. Nobody answered.
    - speaker: Daughter
      text: Where did everyone go?
    - speaker: Daughter
      text: What will happen to us, papa?
    replies:
    - text: They're sleeping.
      reaction:
      - speaker: Daughter
        text: I think I'll sleep too, papa. I'm so tired.
      - speaker: Daughter
        text: Will you stay with me?
    - text: I don't know.
      reaction:
      - speaker: Daughter
        text: It's alright.
      - speaker: Daughter
        text: I'll meet mama again.
  missedAnomalyCard: You missed an an|omaly.
